## API Standards

### Versioning

- All endpoints prefixed with `/api/v1/`
- Breaking changes require new version (`/api/v2/`)
- Deprecate with 6-month warning period

### Response Format

**Success:**
```json
{
  "data": { ... },
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "total": 100
  }
}
```

**Error:**
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "ERROR_CODE",
    "message": "Human readable message",
    "details": []
  }
}
```

### HTTP Status Codes

| Code | Usage |
|------|-------|
| 200 | Success (GET, PUT) |
| 201 | Created (POST) |
| 204 | No Content (DELETE) |
| 400 | Bad Request (validation) |
| 401 | Unauthorized |
| 403 | Forbidden |
| 404 | Not Found |
| 409 | Conflict |
| 500 | Internal Server Error |

